WEBVTT

00:00:03.194 --> 00:00:09.446
Training → Activities lists all your workouts, newest first.

00:00:09.496 --> 00:00:12.862
Pick a period and a sport…

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:17.951
…or search by name.

00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:22.159
An activity: map, charts, laps and zones.

00:00:22.209 --> 00:00:26.063
Say how hard it felt: it counts in the advice.

00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:34.990
Scroll for pace, heart rate and the split over your zones.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:38.191
Was it a test or a race? Choose it as the purpose: VibeSynergy works out your thresholds.

00:00:38.241 --> 00:00:45.276
With a test or race planned that day, this happens by itself.
